tests/test_cli.py:                exit 0
mutation: _atomic_text restored is named in the failure; the two npz writers are not flagged
ruff, all changed files:          7 findings before, 7 after, 0 newly introduced
git apply --check against HEAD:   0
concurrency: no libmlx-mapped process and no model-run lock, checked in the launching command
```

